{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24952","headline":"寒食遣怀 · 张灿","name":"寒食遣怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁华泣清露，悄悄落衣巾。\n明日逢寒食，春风见故人。\n病来羞滞楚，西去欲迷秦。\n憔悴此时久，青山归四邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张灿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}